msgid "%d / 255 (%d%%)"
msgstr "%d / 255（%d%%）"

msgid "%d degrees Celsius, %s"
msgstr "%d 摄氏度，%s"

msgid "%d s"
msgstr "%d 秒"

msgid "%d°C"
msgstr "%d°C"

msgid "%s · kernel safety floor"
msgstr "%s · 内核安全下限"

msgid "5G modem"
msgstr "5G 模组"

msgid "A short boost helps a stopped fan start reliably. Set 0 to disable."
msgstr "短时助推可帮助停转的风扇可靠启动；设为 0 可关闭助推。"

msgid "Actual output"
msgstr "实际输出"

msgid "Add node"
msgstr "添加节点"

msgid "All configured values are valid."
msgstr "所有配置值均有效。"

msgid "Allowed range: %d–%d"
msgstr "允许范围：%d–%d"

msgid "Applied in manual mode. The kernel safety floor may raise the effective output above this value."
msgstr "仅在手动模式下生效。内核安全下限可能使实际输出高于此设置值。"

msgid "At most 16 nodes are supported."
msgstr "最多支持 16 个节点。"

msgid "Attention"
msgstr "需要关注"

msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "自动"

msgid "Automatic curve"
msgstr "自动曲线"

msgid "Automatic follows the fan curve; Manual drives a fixed PWM; Kernel protection only leaves the fan to the kernel governor."
msgstr "自动模式跟随风扇曲线；手动模式输出固定 PWM；仅内核保护模式将风扇完全交给内核调速器。"

msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "均衡"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Cannot read controller status. Check that the h5000m-fancontrol service is installed and running."
msgstr "无法读取控制器状态。请检查 h5000m-fancontrol 服务是否已安装并正在运行。"

msgid "Cannot save the configuration:"
msgstr "无法保存配置："

msgid "Changes apply after Save"
msgstr "保存后生效"

msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "正在检查…"

msgid "Colour bands are plugin reference values. The CPU bands mirror the controller’s kernel cooling-map floors (83/113°C); other sensors use conservative engineering estimates, not official vendor limits. A missing reading is shown as unknown, never as 0°C."
msgstr "颜色分级为本插件参考值。CPU 分级与控制器的内核 cooling-map 阈值（83/113°C）一致；其他传感器采用保守的工程估计值，并非厂商官方上限。缺失的读数显示为未知，绝不会显示为 0°C。"

msgid "Configuration check"
msgstr "配置检查"

msgid "Configuration unchanged; control cycle executed."
msgstr "配置未变化；已执行一次控制循环。"

msgid "Continue"
msgstr "继续"

msgid "Control cycle executed."
msgstr "控制循环已执行。"

msgid "Control cycle failed:"
msgstr "控制循环执行失败："

