msgstr "已停用"

msgid "Drag the dots in the chart or edit the table. Click an empty spot to add a node; double-click a node to remove it."
msgstr "拖动图表中的圆点或直接编辑表格；点击空白处添加节点，双击节点将其删除。"

msgid "Editing the custom curve. Invalid combinations are rejected before saving; the interpolation matches the controller exactly."
msgstr "正在编辑自定义曲线。无效组合会在保存前被拒绝；插值算法与控制器完全一致。"

msgid "Enable enhanced controller"
msgstr "启用增强控制器"

msgid "Ethernet PHY"
msgstr "以太网 PHY"

msgid "Failed to apply cooling policy:"
msgstr "散热策略应用失败："

msgid "FAILSAFE"
msgstr "故障保护"

msgid "Failsafe cooling active"
msgstr "安全散热中"

msgid "Failsafe cooling is active (%s). The controller detected a problem and drives a high output until it recovers."
msgstr "故障保护散热已启用（%s）。控制器检测到异常，将持续高转速输出直至恢复。"

msgid "Fan control"
msgstr "风扇控制"

