msgstr "内核安全下限"

msgid "Kernel thermal protection"
msgstr "内核温控保护"

msgid "Kernel thermal protection is always retained; when the kernel requires more cooling the effective output is raised automatically."
msgstr "内核温控保护始终保留；当内核需要更多散热时，实际输出会自动提高。"

msgid "Kick-off pulse used when the fan restarts from standstill."
msgstr "风扇从停转状态重新启动时使用的助推脉冲。"

msgid "Last error"
msgstr "最后错误"

msgid "Last success"
msgstr "最后成功采样"

