msgstr "H5000M 的实时风扇策略、温度传感器与内核安全保护。"

msgid "Live output"
msgstr "实时输出"

msgid "live query"
msgstr "实时查询"

msgid "Manual"
msgstr "手动"

msgid "Manual PWM below 80 may be too low to keep the fan spinning. Continue?"
msgstr "手动 PWM 低于 80 可能无法维持风扇转动。是否继续？"

