msgstr "响应与安全参数"

msgid "Restart service"
msgstr "重启服务"

msgid "Restart the fan control service? The fan keeps its current output during the restart."
msgstr "重启风扇控制服务？重启期间风扇保持当前输出。"

msgid "Restore default"
msgstr "恢复默认"

msgid "Restore the default custom curve? Your current custom points will be replaced."
msgstr "恢复默认自定义曲线？当前自定义节点将被替换。"

