msgstr "传感器故障 PWM"

msgid "Service restart failed:"
msgstr "服务重启失败："

msgid "Service restarted."
msgstr "服务已重启。"

msgid "Settings saved. The controller picks them up within one control interval."
msgstr "设置已保存。控制器会在一个控制周期内自动加载新配置。"

msgid "Shared with kernel"
msgstr "与内核共享"

msgid "Showing the %s preset from the saved configuration. Switch to Custom to edit your own points."
msgstr "正在显示已保存配置中的「%s」预设。切换到「自定义」可编辑自己的控制点。"

msgid "Speed-down delay"
msgstr "降速延迟"

