msgstr "温度"

msgid "The enhanced controller is about to be disabled. The fan will follow the kernel thermal policy only. Continue?"
msgstr "即将停用增强控制器。风扇将仅跟随内核温控策略。是否继续？"

msgid "The fan manager owns the fan policy. Kernel CPU throttling and hot/critical over-temperature protection remain active."
msgstr "风扇管理器独占风扇策略控制；内核 CPU 降频及高温/临界过热保护仍保持启用。"

msgid "Thermal zone"
msgstr "温区"

msgid "These parameters never bypass kernel protection: CPU throttling, hot and critical trips stay under kernel control in every mode."
msgstr "这些参数绝不会绕过内核保护：无论何种模式，CPU 降频、高温与临界温控点始终由内核管理。"

msgid "unknown"
msgstr "未知"

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "未知"

msgid "UNKNOWN"
msgstr "未知"

msgid "unknown output"
msgstr "输出未知"

msgid "Unsaved changes have been discarded."
msgstr "未保存的修改已放弃。"

msgid "unsupported"
msgstr "不支持"

msgid "Use comma-separated temperature:percent points, e.g. 35:0,45:50,70:80,90:100. Temperatures must rise, 0–150°C, percentages 0–100."
msgstr "请使用逗号分隔的「温度:百分比」控制点，例如 35:0,45:50,70:80,90:100。温度必须递增（0–150°C），百分比范围为 0–100。"

msgid "Userspace (kernel CPU throttling intact)"
msgstr "用户空间（内核 CPU 降频保护完整）"

msgid "Vendor driver (iwpriv)"
msgstr "厂商驱动（iwpriv）"

msgid "Wait this many seconds before lowering fan output; increases apply immediately."
msgstr "降低风扇输出前等待指定秒数；温度升高会立即响应。"

msgid "Waiting before speed down"
msgstr "等待降速"

msgid "Warning: the CPU thermal governor reports user_space. Kernel CPU throttling may be disabled - check your firmware and the controller release notes."
msgstr "警告：CPU 温控调速器报告为 user_space，内核 CPU 降频保护可能已被禁用——请检查固件与控制器版本说明。"

msgid "When disabled, the fan follows the kernel thermal protection level only."
msgstr "停用后，风扇将仅跟随内核温控保护等级。"

msgid "Wi-Fi radio 1"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 射频 1"

msgid "Wi-Fi radio 2"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 射频 2"

msgid "Wi-Fi radios"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 射频"

